<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-IN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>RJ Tutorials, Chembur | Class 8–12 tuition, NEET, JEE &amp; MHT-CET coaching</title>
<meta name="description" content="RJ Tutorials, Chembur: tuition for Class 8, 10 and junior college (Science & Commerce) for SSC, ICSE and CBSE, plus NEET, MHT-CET and JEE preparation. Next to Cubic Mall, Dr. C.G. Road. Call 88795 52477.">
<!-- Demo only: remove the next line when this goes live on RJ Tutorials' own domain -->
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#14233F">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
